  m_text: '<size=34><b>EGOANCHOR COLLECTION</b></size>

    <color=#4DD6A6>[REC]
    RECORDING</color> | Session: Not Started

    <size=22>SERVER  WAITING FOR PYTHON
    SESSION ID</size>

    NEXT  <size=25><b><color=#FFD054>WHEN TARGET IS VISIBLE:
    M / TRIGGER</color></b></size>

    TASKS  <color=#5BA9FF>0/9 COMPLETE</color>

    <color=#B1BCCC>
    [ ]1 HEAD       </color><color=#B1BCCC> [ ]2 6DOF       </color><color=#B1BCCC>
    [ ]3 MOVE       </color>

    <color=#B1BCCC> [ ]4 ROT        </color><b><color=#4DD6A6>>[RUN]5
    OCC      </color></b><color=#B1BCCC> [ ]6 ALIGN      </color>

    <color=#B1BCCC>
    [ ]7 VCD        </color><color=#B1BCCC> [ ]8 TEMP       </color><color=#B1BCCC>
    [ ]9 LOCK       </color>

    CURRENT  <b>5. Occlusion and reappearance</b>

    STATE 
    <color=#6DD3FF>TARGET OCCLUDED</color> | TIME  <color=#4DD6A6>01:36 / 01:30-02:00</color>

    MARKER 
    <size=24><color=#FFA95C>M / Trigger when the target becomes visible.</color></size>

    <size=22>SELECT 
    Stick / Arrows / Number 1-9

    START   A / Enter / Numpad Enter    MARK   Trigger
    / M

    END     B / E                       REJECT Stick Click / Space</size>

'
